<title>NETHERLANDS: Unilever completes chemicals sale to ICI.</title>
<headline>Unilever completes chemicals sale to ICI.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever confirmed on Tuesday that it had now completed the sale of its international specialty chemicals businesses to Britain's ICI for a debt-free price of $8 billion.</p>
<p>ICI said last week that the deal, announced on May 7, would be completed by July 8.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
